00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Artificial intelligence, or AI, refers to the development of computer systems that can think and learn like humans. It involves the use of algorithms and data to enable machines to make decisions and solve problems. AI has a transformative impact on our world, revolutionizing industries and revolutionizing the way we live and work. From virtual assistants to self-driving cars, AI is being integrated into various aspects of life. Its applications in data science and machine learning are also transforming the way we analyze and understand the world around us. Understanding AI is crucial for navigating its future implications.
